WEBVTT

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:26.120
<i>How many of those starry 
fantasies have been forgotten</i>

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:31.720
<i>The old dreams no longer shine</i>

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:37.470
<i>The paths that we have walked 
together are precious treasures</i>

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:43.340
<i>Nothing can hold us back</i>

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:48.720
<i>I won't be afraid how long it is tonight</i>

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:54.050
<i>As long as you stand by my side</i>

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:57.930
<i>Pierce the night sky like 
the first glow of dawn</i>

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.520
<i>And try my best to light the earth</i>

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:03.070
<i>Break through the chains of fate</i>

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:04.340
<i>No dodge</i>

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:05.510
<i>No surrender</i>

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:09.060
<i>On the battlefield your gaze empowers me</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:11.990
<i>No fear to embrace hope</i>

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:17.850
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:23.930
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:01:29.390 --> 00:01:32.270
<b>Episode Nine
The Last Summoner, Season 1, Part 1</b>

00:01:36.870 --> 00:01:38.520
Ah Jie! Ah Jie!

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.160
He's lost too much blood,

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:43.230
and the wounds are deep.

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:45.850
I'll patch him up a little.

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:48.160
Miaowu's got a fever, too.

00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:49.300
Her wounds got infected.

00:01:50.260 --> 00:01:52.660
I just hope that the Destroyers 
won't catch up to us too soon.

00:01:52.660 --> 00:01:56.300
<i>Beep, beep, beep! Red alert!</i>

00:01:57.830 --> 00:01:59.790
<i>Strong spiritual energy 
fluctuations detected!</i>

00:01:59.790 --> 00:02:02.450
<i>Rapidly approaching this location!</i>

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:03.600
What?

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:09.850
Shadow Blade,

00:02:10.370 --> 00:02:11.140
release!

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:13.480
That was fast!

00:02:16.090 --> 00:02:17.560
<i>The Destroyers...</i>

00:02:21.130 --> 00:02:24.350
How does it feel to go from being 
the hunter to being the prey?

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:39.600
Have a taste of despair.

00:03:00.830 --> 00:03:02.080
Miaowu!

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:03.420
Stan!

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.300
Disappointing.

00:03:11.890 --> 00:03:13.430
Is this all you've got?

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:20.000
Save your breath.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:27.270
After you die, I will read your 
last words directly from your brain.

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:32.720
Space Cutter.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:42.160
Ah Jie!

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:46.240
Ah Jie!

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:01.510
I...

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:02.990
Where am I?

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:06.570
This is a gap between time and space.

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:16.940
I'm sorry to tell you this,

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:19.000
but in the time line you came from,

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:21.270
you have died.

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:27.370
Dora!

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:28.580
Miaowu!

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:29.620
Stan!

00:04:31.570 --> 00:04:32.770
All dead.

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:38.450
After that, the Destroyers absorbed 
all your summoned spirits

00:04:39.140 --> 00:04:40.740
and memories.

00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:44.430
Damn it!

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:54.200
Everyone must pay the price for failure,

00:04:54.990 --> 00:04:56.650
even if that price is high.

00:04:57.890 --> 00:05:00.860
It's all my fault... for not 
being able to do anything!

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:04.310
It's my fault... for not 
being strong enough!

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:09.970
If I told you...

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:15.470
I could offer you three minutes 
to salvage everything,

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:18.190
would you be able 
to turn it all around?

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:27.350
Give it your best, Ah Jie.

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:28.870
And remember:

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:31.390
When all of this comes to an end,

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:34.740
I will be waiting for you 
at the Demon Furnace.

00:05:35.220 --> 00:05:36.210
D...

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:37.370
Dad...

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:44.560
He's lost too much blood,

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:46.710
and the wounds are deep.

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:49.060
I'll patch him up a little.

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:51.260
<i>He really did turn back time...</i>

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:53.820
<i>It's three minutes in the past.</i>

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:54.470
Ah Jie!

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:56.470
Everyone, listen up.

00:05:58.280 --> 00:06:00.460
Listen to every word I'm about to say.

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:09.960
We'll be teleported to the destination soon.

00:06:09.960 --> 00:06:11.590
Our objective:

00:06:11.590 --> 00:06:13.600
kill on sight.

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:15.060
Understood.

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:18.500
Shadow Blade,

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:19.100
release!

00:06:22.350 --> 00:06:23.500
No one's there?!

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:24.350
<i>Counting down.</i>

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:25.300
<i>Three...</i>

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:26.650
<i>Two...</i>

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:27.460
<i>One...</i>

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:28.810
It's a trap!

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.410
Confirming destruction of the RV.

00:06:41.410 --> 00:06:43.080
One of them was caught in the blast.

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:44.160
That was close.

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:47.640
It's all thanks to Ah Jie's plan to 
switch cars that we got away safely.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:50.060
This won't buy us much time.

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:52.020
The Destroyers will catch up to us soon.

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:54.770
We need to pick Hana up 
before they get to her.

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:55.740
Got it!

00:06:57.070 --> 00:06:58.850
Nitro boost!

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:09.440
Hana!

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:10.890
Pack your things and come with us!

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:18.390
Where is she?

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:20.750
Crap. Are we too late?

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:27.690
She left a letter.

00:07:32.820 --> 00:07:34.270
Hey! Come on, you two!

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:36.170
I've got good and bad news!

00:07:36.170 --> 00:07:39.140
The bad news is the Destroyers 
are only two kilometers away!

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:40.890
What about the good news?

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:45.520
The good news...

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:48.290
is that I borrowed Hana's 
helicopter for our getaway!

00:07:53.480 --> 00:07:54.670
Let's go!

00:07:57.290 --> 00:07:58.450
Activate stealth mode!

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:04.580
In other words, Hana's missing.

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:05.920
The letter's all she left behind.

00:08:06.970 --> 00:08:07.680
Right.

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:13.470
I'm waiting for you at the Demon Furnace.
-Hana

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:13.470
You'd better turn up alive!!

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:12.620
"I'm waiting for you at the Demon Furnace."

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:15.460
The Demon Furnace again?

00:08:15.960 --> 00:08:17.740
Just like what my old man said before.

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:20.580
When all of this comes to an end,

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:22.610
I will be waiting for you 
at the Demon Furnace.

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:24.640
The Demon Furnace?!

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:27.220
That sounds familiar.

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:30.710
Before, when I was asking 
around about my brother,

00:08:30.710 --> 00:08:32.890
someone told me that he had been there.

00:08:33.670 --> 00:08:37.310
Supposedly, it's for participating in some 
kind of trial to make oneself stronger.

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:39.250
You're right!

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:41.200
The legendary Demon Furnace.

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:44.430
A holy site for all Summoners 
since ancient times!

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:47.290
It's the grandest arena there is!

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:50.350
Long ago, only those who passed 
the trials at the Demon Furnace

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:53.810
could graduate from apprentices 
to full-fledged Summoners!

00:08:53.810 --> 00:08:55.770
Not just the Destroyers, either.

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:59.290
Even Hana's grandpa and his 
friends trained there back then.

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:04.550
Some say that place is heaven.

00:09:04.550 --> 00:09:06.640
Others say it's hell.

00:09:06.950 --> 00:09:09.720
The legend goes that, hidden in the 
deepest part of the Demon Furnace,

00:09:09.720 --> 00:09:12.220
one may find mysterious 
spiritual energy and treasures

00:09:12.600 --> 00:09:16.540
and the past and 
future of the entire world!

00:09:18.010 --> 00:09:19.410
But unfortunately,

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:21.410
I don't have enough info.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:24.780
If I had any kind of clue as to its location,

00:09:24.780 --> 00:09:27.310
I would've gone long ago!

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:29.610
How about looking up these coordinates?

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:31.560
I'm waiting for you at the Demon Furnace.
-Hana

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:31.560
You'd better turn up alive!!

00:09:30.240 --> 00:09:31.560
That's probably where it is.

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:38.270
You're right! This is it!

00:09:38.270 --> 00:09:39.880
<i>Target acquired!</i>

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:44.230
We're about 7,000 kilometers away.

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:45.780
If we fly straight there,

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:47.980
we'll arrive in seven hours!

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:50.170
How about it, then?

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:52.180
Have you guys thought it through?

00:09:52.910 --> 00:09:54.980
Not like we have much choice anymore.

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:57.180
Rather than wait to be hunted down,

00:09:57.180 --> 00:09:59.930
I say we go to the Devil's 
Furnace and try our luck.

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:02.950
We might be able to gear up and grind,

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:05.920
maybe even find some secret 
tomes or a grandmaster!

00:10:05.920 --> 00:10:06.930
Exactly!

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:08.480
Great, then.

00:10:09.110 --> 00:10:11.040
Next stop: the Demon Furnace!

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.340
Full speed ahead!

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:15.580
Right. There's a first aid kit 
and some food on board.

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:16.580
Try to recuperate.

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:18.420
Get some sleep.

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:20.100
Got it!

00:10:33.870 --> 00:10:36.120
Hey! Everyone, wake up.

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:36.850
We're almost there.

00:10:47.230 --> 00:10:50.340
Over the last few decades, countless 
airplanes and ships met disaster here.

00:10:50.820 --> 00:10:53.270
They call this place the Sea of Death.

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:56.560
Our destination is hidden inside.

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:06.680
Watch out!

00:11:11.110 --> 00:11:12.120
Hold on tight!

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:16.700
This is scary!

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:18.930
Stan, are you sure you found the right place?

00:11:20.160 --> 00:11:23.700
Fog, whirlpools, tornadoes, 
thunder and wind storms...

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:26.020
It's exactly as the legends say!

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:29.910
The strongest Summoner commands 
all of Mother Nature's powers!

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:31.930
Normal people and the mundane world

00:11:31.930 --> 00:11:34.420
are all sealed out by this boundary!

00:11:43.650 --> 00:11:46.020
My head's spinning!

00:11:58.000 --> 00:11:59.870
We finally made it through!

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:08.200
Great!

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:09.850
Is that the Demon Furnace?

00:12:10.800 --> 00:12:11.740
What?

00:12:17.120 --> 00:12:18.660
It's beautiful.

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:21.350
Are we in paradise?

00:12:22.490 --> 00:12:23.680
Congrats, everyone!

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:27.100
Our flight will be landing at 
our destination in five minutes!

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:31.350
I can't wait to hop down there 
and soak in the water!

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:33.210
Right, Ah Jie?

00:12:36.870 --> 00:12:37.580
Ah Jie!

00:12:38.060 --> 00:12:39.780
Why are you still so tense?

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:42.220
We made it past the storm!

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:45.500
Don't you guys think 
something's not quite right?

00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:50.390
Shadow Blade...

00:12:50.730 --> 00:12:51.330
Holy Shield!

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:52.810
Slash!

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:02.430
Stan!

00:13:02.430 --> 00:13:03.640
Watch this!

00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:06.560
Helicopter,

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:07.930
transform!

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:28.640
Mystic Cannon!

00:13:29.470 --> 00:13:30.720
Phantom Sword!

00:13:30.720 --> 00:13:31.810
Claw Wind!

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:40.700
She got away!

00:13:41.230 --> 00:13:42.270
Damn it!

00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:46.870
Enemy at 9 o'clock!

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:52.600
Die! Die! Die!

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:57.870
Death Rays!

00:13:59.870 --> 00:14:00.790
Spirit Sword!

00:14:00.790 --> 00:14:01.430
Claw Wind!

00:14:04.180 --> 00:14:05.890
Too slow! Too slow!

00:14:19.690 --> 00:14:20.720
Mystic Cannon!

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:25.130
Got 'im!

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:36.700
Crap. The robot can't last any longer!

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:38.220
We're falling!

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:40.020
Head straight toward the Furnace!

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:41.580
If we're gonna die, we'll die there!

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:10.600
Them again!

00:15:26.430 --> 00:15:27.630
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:29.840
<i>So there's no escaping them?</i>

00:15:35.480 --> 00:15:36.350
Hey!

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:39.700
That's against the rules!

00:15:40.310 --> 00:15:41.100
Reckless flying!

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:41.890
Group brawls!

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:42.910
Munitions misuse!

00:15:42.910 --> 00:15:43.680
Environmental pollution!

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:49.180
Your actions have already violated twelve

00:15:49.570 --> 00:15:51.220
of the island's rules!

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:55.680
As administrator, I, Bonnie, 
am issuing all of you a final warning!

00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:00.050
Hey.

00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:01.970
Do you know who we are?

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:05.640
Do you know where <i>you</i> are?

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:07.220
This is...

00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:10.330
the Demon Furnace!

00:16:22.220 --> 00:16:28.710
<i>Sit with you watching the night sky</i>

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:33.950
<i>Vast stars reflect in our eyes</i>

00:16:34.480 --> 00:16:41.540
<i>Like thousands of tiny wishes in our hearts</i>

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:47.060
<i>Longing to discover the origin of the 
mysterious everlasting ancient world</i>

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:52.050
<i>The past and the present are 
linked in a fantastic instant</i>

00:16:52.050 --> 00:16:57.050
<i>Watch over our beautiful 
home against evil forever</i>

00:16:57.050 --> 00:17:02.040
<i>The blazing sun is our inevitable 
cruel test of growth</i>

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:07.090
<i>May we return from thorny 
paths still being young</i>

00:17:07.090 --> 00:17:12.090
<i>With love and hate, laughter and 
tears, compose every touching moment</i>

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:17.050
<i>Five friends shoulder to shoulder, 
friendship will last until eternity</i>

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:24.500
<i>With you tomorrow must 
be full of shining hopes</i>

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:29.650
<i>Our tomorrow</i>
